    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这期播客中，我做客进击波财经，跟波波探讨减肥的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟着波波的提问，我也分享了很多关于健康饮食和科学减肥的实用建议。</span></p><span></span><p><span>探讨了在忙碌的生活中做出健康选择的必备技巧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a>:如何在现代生活中保持健康</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">00:04:07</a>:如何让碳水化合物为你所用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">00:06:09</a>:让你的能量更持久的方法在这里！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">00:08:11</a>:从板块缺失到优化细节的饮食解决方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">00:10:11</a>:控制主食的品质，科学减肥更轻松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">00:12:12</a>:控制嘴，激活身体内在激素调节水平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">00:16:24</a>:东方健康膳食探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">00:18:44</a>:建立新生活理念和生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">00:21:04</a>:打造持久陪伴的新生活理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">00:23:26</a>:了解预制菜：选择健康又美味的饮食方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">00:25:47</a>:确定主食的克重以及合理摄入关键</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙 本期主播：田雪×波波</span></p><span></span><p><span>📝 shownotes图文：potato</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂ 音频剪辑：potato</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏 欢迎关注🍠@田雪_吃出漂亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉 听友群 VX：chichupiaoliang（备注平台）</span></p><span></span><p><span>💰 商务联系：chichupiaoliang（备注来意）</span></p>]]></description>
